.\docs\concepts\project-layout.md:15:    architecture/         <- your own notes; any folder works
.\docs\concepts\project-layout.md:19:Every folder name is configurable. The names above are the defaults from [`md2.config.json`](../guide/configuration.md); the built-in fallbacks are `design`, `active`, `actions`, `history`, `archived`.
