.\design\releases\0_0_3\F-7-electron-local-folder-project-mode.md:14:Make the Electron application open a local project folder containing a Git repository and use that folder as the authoritative source for every project operation. GitHub repository opening remains a browser-app workflow; a GitHub remote in the selected local repository is handled through normal local Git commands.
